    "lastText": "The migration is finished: every function and method in `src/` is now `async` and takes no callback, and `runWorker` takes an async handler. The auditor returned VERDICT: PASS.\n\n- **Checks:** `npm test` passes, 14 of 14. `node examples/basic.js` prints three `done` lines and `processed 3`. All five acceptance criteria in `.goal/SPEC.md` pass.\n- **Constructor:** the `Queue` constructor stays synchronous, since a constructor can't be async.\n- **Races fixed:** the promise version exposed two concurrency bugs under `concurrency: 2`, and I fixed both in `src/queue.js`. Concurrent saves collided on the shared temp file, so `_save` now runs them one at a time. Two workers could also claim the same job, so `pop()` now re-checks that the job is still pending.\n- **Tests:** I rewrote the three existing test files to `async`/`await`. The auditor confirmed each one keeps the same scenarios and assertions. `test/helpers.js` is unchanged.\n- **Docs and example:** `examples/basic.js` and the README use the new API.\n- **Added files:** I added five small check scripts under `scripts/`, which the acceptance criteria run.",
